%% Each message names the data that moves. An icon marks each data type. The page has the legend:
%% 🔑 public key · 🧾 BTCR2 Signed Update · 🔖 32-byte hash · 🌲 SMT Proof · 📝 Unsigned Beacon Signal
%% ✍ signature · ⛓ Beacon Signal · 🏷 Beacon Address · 🆔 did · 💬 channel message · 🧳 Sidecar Data · 📄 DID document

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Stu as Stuart
    participant AS as Aggregation<br/>Service 🤝
    participant BTC as Bitcoin ⛓
    actor Sat as Satoshi

    Stu->>Stu: 🔑 new key → 🧾 update<br/>→ 🔖 hash of the update
    Stu->>AS: 🔖 leaf value
    AS->>Stu: 🌲 SMT Proof,<br/>📝 Unsigned Beacon Signal
    Stu->>AS: ✍ signature
    AS->>BTC: ⛓ Beacon Signal<br/>with the 🌲 SMT root
    Stu->>Sat: 💬 message, 🆔 did, 🧳 Sidecar Data<br/>(🧾 update, 🌲 SMT Proof)
    Sat->>BTC: Find the Beacon Signals<br/>of the 🏷 Beacon Addresses
    BTC-->>Sat: ⛓ Beacon Signals
    Sat->>Sat: 📄 DID document<br/>with the 🔑 new key
